  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>NutritionFacts.org arises from my annual review of the medical literature. With the help of a team of hundreds of volunteers, we churned through tens of thousands of papers published in the peer-reviewed scientific nutrition literature and are ramping up to break new records in 2021. How do I choose which studies to highlight? In general, I strive to focus on the most groundbreaking, interesting, and useful findings; but which topics resonate the most? The practical ones, offering cooking or shopping tips? Or those that dissect the studies behind the headlines? Maybe it’s the geeky science ones exploring the wonderfully weird world of human biology? As you can see from the below list, the answer seems to be a bit of all of the above.</p>\n<p><strong>#10 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/stainless-steel-or-cast-iron-which-cookware-is-best-is-teflon-safe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stainless Steel or Cast Iron: Which Cookware Is Best? Is Teflon Safe?</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63716 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Stainless Steel or Cast Iron: Which Cookware Is Best? Is Teflon Safe?\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a></p>\n<p>This was the second in a three-video series on cookware. The first was <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-aluminum-pots-bottles-and-foil-safe/\">Are Aluminum Pots, Bottles, and Foil Safe?</a>.</p>\n<p>What about pressure cooking? I covered that in <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/does-pressure-cooking-preserve-nutrients/\">Does Pressure Cooking Preserve Nutrients?</a>.</p>\n<p>Other popular practical videos of 2020 included <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-ancient-grains-healthier/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Are Ancient Grains Healthier?</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-pre-cut-vegetables-just-as-healthy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Are Pre-Cut Vegetables Just as Healthy?</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#9 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-of-garlic-for-fighting-cancer-and-the-common-cold/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Benefits of Garlic for Fighting Cancer and the Common Cold</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-61503 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/49-07-Benefits-of-Garlic-for-Fighting-Cancer-and-the-Common-Cold.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>Another really popular garlic video this year was the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-of-garlic-powder-for-heart-disease/\">Benefits of Garlic Powder for Heart Disease</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#8 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-symptoms-of-vitamin-b12-deficiency/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Symptoms of Vitamin B12 Deficiency</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-65204 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Symptoms of Vitamin B12 Deficiency\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>This was the first in a 5-video series on B12. The other four were:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-optimal-vitamin-b12-dosage-for-adults/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Optimal Vitamin B12 Dosage for Adults</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-healthiest-food-sources-of-vitamin-b12/\">Healthiest Food Sources of Vitamin B12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-optimal-vitamin-b12-dosage-for-kids-pregnancy-and-seniors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Optimal Vitamin B12 Dosage for Kids, Pregnancy, and Seniors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-type-of-vitamin-B12-cyanocobalamin-or-methylcobalamin/\">The Best Type of Vitamin B12: Cyanocobalamin or Methylcobalamin?</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#7 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-lower-blood-pressure-naturally-with-lifestyle-changes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to Lower Blood Pressure Naturally with Lifestyle Changes</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-62161 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Lower Blood Pressure Naturally with Lifestyle Changes\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-22-How-to-Lower-Blood-Pressure-Naturally-with-Lifestyle-Changes.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>This was the second in a 3-video series.The first one was also really popular—<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-the-new-blood-pressure-range-guidelines-mean/\">What the New Blood Pressure Range Guidelines Mean</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#6 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-of-flax-seeds-for-inflammation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Benefits of Flax Seeds for Inflammation</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-60913 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"Benefits of Flax Seeds for Inflammation\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/48-20.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>My <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-are-the-best-foods/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">What Are the Best Foods?</a> video was also popular last year. I would certainly consider flax seeds and all the other foods on the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dr-gregers-daily-dozen-checklist/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Daily Dozen</a> to be among the best.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#5 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-bcaa-branched-chain-amino-acids-healthy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Are BCAA (Branched Chain Amino Acids) Healthy?</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-61074 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"Are BCAA (Branched Chain Amino Acids) Healthy?\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/48-26.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>This may help explain some of the benefits of plant-based proteins. I imagine I’ll explore this topic more in my next book, <em>How Not to Age</em>, on the latest in longevity research.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#4 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/foods-that-help-headache-and-migraine-relief/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Foods That Help Headache and Migraine Relief</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-62204 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Foods that Help Headache and Migraine Relief\" width=\"208\" height=\"117\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/03/49-24-2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 208px) 100vw, 208px\"/></a>Another really popular 2020 video exploring the clinical effects of certain foods was <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-lower-lpa-with-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to Lower LP(a) with Diet</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#3 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/eat-more-calories-in-the-morning-to-lose-weight/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eat More Calories in the Morning to Lose Weight</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-61690 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"Eat More Calories in the Morning Than the Evening\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/01/49-09.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>It’s not just what we eat, but when! Other popular chronobiology videos in 2020 were <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-circadian-rhythms-affect-blood-sugar-levels/\">How Circadian Rhythms Affect Blood Sugar Levels</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-benefits-of-early-time-restricted-eating/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Benefits of Early Time-Restricted Eating.</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#2 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-covid-19-pandemic-may-just-be-a-dress-rehearsal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The COVID-19 Pandemic May Just Be a Dress Rehearsal</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-64294 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-1024x576.png\" alt=\"The COVID-19 Pandemic May Just Be a Dress Rehearsal\" width=\"210\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/16-–-The-COVID-19-Pandemic-May-Just-Be-a-Dress-Rehearsal.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></a>I did a whole 14-part video series on the pandemic, based on my book <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\">How to Survive a Pandemic</a></em>. The other three most popular of the set were:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-prevent-the-next-pandemic/\">How to Prevent the Next Pandemic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/covid-19-symptoms-vs-the-flu-a-cold-or-allergies/\">COVID-19 Symptoms vs. the Flu, a Cold or Allergies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-avoid-covid-19/\">How to Avoid COVID-19</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>#1 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Evidence-Based Weight Loss</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-60989 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-1024x576.png\" alt=\"Evidence Based Weight Loss\" width=\"212\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/11/EBWL-Thumbnail-Option-B.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 212px) 100vw, 212px\"/></a>This live presentation was based on my book <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How Not to Diet</a></em>. If you want to watch the presentation I did for my last book, check out <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How Not to Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</a>. The other two most popular weight loss videos this year were <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-weight-loss-and-disease-prevention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Best Diet for Weight Loss and Disease Prevention</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/cut-the-calorie-rich-and-processed-foods/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cut the Calorie-Rich-and-Processed-Foods.</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>"
  }
}
